  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0 — first stable release. The .pqfe container format (v2) is FROZEN for the 1.x line. Public API surface is locked by Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.PublicApiAnalyzers; EnablePackageValidation enforces binary compatibility against the previous release at pack time. Same library code as 1.0.0-rc.3 — no format, public-API, or runtime-dependency change. This release adds the reproducible-build verification recipe (docs/REPRODUCIBLE-BUILDS.md, .github/scripts/verify-reproducibility.sh, .github/workflows/reproducibility.yml) so a third party can rebuild a tagged release bit-identically and diff against the .nupkg on nuget.org; weekly BenchmarkDotNet throughput runs (.github/workflows/benchmarks.yml); and refreshes SUPPORT, THREAT-MODEL, and VERSIONING for the 1.x lifecycle. EnablePackageValidation against the 1.0.0-rc.3 baseline. See CHANGELOG.md.",
